---
import ContentPageLayout from '../layouts/ContentPageLayout.astro';

---
<ContentPageLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact MiniAdda about corrections, feedback or partnership questions."
  heading="Contact"
  crumb="Contact"
>
  <p>
    We welcome corrections, questions and feedback.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    Write to <a href="mailto:hello@miniadda.com">hello@miniadda.com</a>. For corrections, please
    include the article URL and, if possible, a source for the correct information.
  </p>

  <h2>Response time</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to respond within a few business days. Factual corrections are prioritised.
  </p>

  <p>
    We do not accept paid placements or sponsored answers. See our
    <a href="/editorial">Editorial Policy</a>.
  </p>
</ContentPageLayout>
